{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53884","headline":"玉泉 · 杜牧","name":"玉泉","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"山股遥飞泉，泓澄傍岩石。\n乱垂寒玉条，碎洒珍珠滴。\n澄波涵万象，明镜泻天色。\n有时乘月来，赏迹还自适。\n（《古今图书集成·职方典》卷五七四《庆阳府部》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜牧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53884.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53884","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}